entries[98533] = { ["name"] = "Extinct Turtle Shell", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 15\nTurtles are ancient creatures that have changed little over the eons. There are three main categories: sea turtles, land tortoises and fresh-water-dwelling terrapins. This shell is probably from a tortoise, though it is nigh impenetrable and would make a fantastic, if slightly silly, shield.\nExtinct Turtle Shell\nBinds to account\nOff Hand Shield\n11896 Armor\n+190 Strength\n+286 Stamina\n+ 114 Dodge\n+ 134 Mastery\nDurability 75 / 75\n85" }
