entries[98582] = { ["name"] = "Pterrordax Hatchling", ["text"] = "2 sec cast 15\nIt's an adorable green baby pterrordax! Luckily, at this size, her sonic screeches won't turn your eardrums to bloody pulps and while she'll TRY to eat your face, it just feels like friendly little lizard-bird-thing kisses. Awww!\nPterrordax Hatchling\nBinds when picked up\nUse: Teaches you how to summon this companion.\nRight Click to summon and dismiss your Pterrordax Hatchling." }
